https://github.com/databendlabs/databend/issues/20645 confirmed

DROP DATABASE IF EXISTS repro_databend922_db59_min;
CREATE DATABASE repro_databend922_db59_min;
USE repro_databend922_db59_min;

CREATE TABLE s(id BIGINT NOT NULL, v INT NULL) ENGINE=MEMORY;
CREATE TABLE l(id BIGINT NOT NULL) ENGINE=MEMORY;
CREATE TABLE r(id BIGINT NOT NULL, v INT NULL) ENGINE=MEMORY;

INSERT INTO s VALUES (1, 1);
INSERT INTO l SELECT id FROM s;
INSERT INTO r SELECT id, v FROM s;

-- 单表：成功，返回 NULL
SELECT AVG(id)
FROM s
WHERE -2 * id NOT IN (id, -id)
  AND -id = id;

-- 多表：报错，预期同样返回 NULL
SELECT AVG(id)
FROM (
    SELECT l.id,
           (SELECT r.v FROM r WHERE r.id = l.id) AS v
    FROM l
    WHERE EXISTS (
        SELECT 1 FROM r WHERE r.id = l.id
    )
) AS s
WHERE -2 * id NOT IN (id, -id)
  AND -id = id;

单表：
NULL

多表：
ERROR 1105 (HY000):
SemanticError. Code: 1065,
Text = cannot access the "r"."id" in ANTI or SEMI join. 

单表计划的关键部分如下，省略估算行数和列编号：
EvalScalar
  expressions: sum(id) / if(count(id) = 0, 1, count(id))
└── AggregateFinal
    aggregate functions: [sum(id), count()]
    └── AggregatePartial
        aggregate functions: [sum(id), count()]
        └── Filter
            filters:
              -s.id = s.id
              NOT (-2 * -s.id = -s.id OR -2 * -s.id = s.id)
              NOT (-2 * s.id = s.id OR -2 * s.id = -s.id)
            └── TableScan
                table: repro_databend922_db59_min.s
                read rows: 1
多表查询加 EXPLAIN，仍报相同 Code 1065，无法生成执行计划

为展示相关子查询的正常转换路径，删除 NOT IN 后的多表对照查询可以执行并返回 NULL：
EXPLAIN
SELECT AVG(id)
FROM (
    SELECT l.id,
           (SELECT r.v FROM r WHERE r.id = l.id) AS v
    FROM l
    WHERE EXISTS (
        SELECT 1 FROM r WHERE r.id = l.id
    )
) AS s
WHERE -id = id;
该对照的实际计划骨架：
EvalScalar
└── AggregateFinal [sum(id), count()]
    └── AggregatePartial [sum(id), count()]
        └── HashJoin [RIGHT SINGLE]
            ├── HashJoin [RIGHT SEMI]
            │   ├── Filter [l.id = -s.id]
            │   │   └── TableScan l
            │   └── TableScan r
            └── TableScan r

多表查询的语义结果应为 NULL，实际报 Code 1065 是优化器 bug。单表计划和去掉 NOT IN 的对照计划都说明问题出在 NOT IN 与内部 EXISTS/SEMI JOIN 的交互上。